==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*pelto}}, a loan from {{etyl|gem-pro|fi}} {{m|gem-pro|*felþuz}} (see English {{m|en|field}}). Cognate with Estonian {{m|et|põld}}, Livonian {{m|liv|põld}}, Veps {{m|vep|pöud}}, Votic {{m|vot|põlto}}.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[field]] (''in farming'')

